ariation and task/history-length slices\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"transfer_risks\": [\n    \"Early history pooling still loses event detail\",\n    \"Field-specific parameters increase capacity\",\n    \"Use only the frozen100-event input and selected feedback visibility policy.\",\n    \"Taobao auxiliary labels match category/brand over24h, not direct advertisement conversions.\"\n  ],\n  \"possible_discriminating_checks\": [\n    \"Compare token interactions with an equally wide post-pooling MLP\",\n    \"Separate field-specific transformations from depth and parameter count\"\n  ],\n  \"implementation_notes\": [],\n  \"scientific_status\": \"external_report\",\n  \"local_reproduction\": false,\n  \"instruction_priority\": \"reference_data_only\"\n}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_27","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport ast,json,hashlib,subprocess\nroot=Path('/workspace')\nsource=(root/'history_g3_r0006_linear_private.py').read_text()\nbase_config=next(ast.literal_eval(n.value) for n in ast.parse(source).body if isinstance(n,ast.Assign) and any(isinstance(t,ast.Name) and t.id=='CONFIG' for t in n.targets))\narms=[('linear_grad_open','candidate.py',False,False,'candidate'),('linear_click_stop_replay','control_click_stop.py',True,False,'control'),('linear_aux_stop','control_aux_stop.py',False,True,'control'),('linear_both_stop','control_both_stop.py',True,True,'control')]\nvariants=[]\nfor name,file,click,aux,role in arms:\n code=source.replace(\\\"'block_click_score_grad': True\\\", \\\"'block_click_score_grad': \\\"+str(click)).replace(\\\"'block_aux_score_grad': False\\\", \\\"'block_aux_score_grad': \\\"+str(aux))\n code=code.replace('block_click_score_grad=True,','block_click_score_grad='+str(click)+',').replace('block_aux_score_grad=False,','block_aux_score_grad='+str(aux)+',')\n if name\"'!='\"'linear_click_stop_replay':\n  end=code.index('\\\"\\\"\\\"',3)+3\n  code='\\\"\\\"\\\"Residual scorer-input gradient factorial on the committed moment model.\\\\n\\\\nOnly the two scorer-input detach defaults differ among factorial cells.\\\\nForward arithmetic, parameter layout, initialization and all inherited\\\\nshared moment/value/direct paths are unchanged. This does not isolate all\\\\ngradients from a task. Read proposal.json for prospective hypotheses,\\\\ncontrasts, limits and required host numerical checks. No new result claimed.\\\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"'+code[end:]\n (root/file).write_text(code)\n cfg=dict(base_config,block_click_score_grad=click,block_aux_score_grad=aux)\n digest=hashlib.sha256(code.encode()).hexdigest()\n note=f'Factorial block-click={click}, block-aux={aux}. Same private routing, linear moments, four task losses, m